  "title": "AeroVironment, Inc. to Host Investor Day in New York City, New York on July 8",
  "summary": "ARLINGTON, Va. — Jun. 17, 2026 — AeroVironment, Inc. (“AV”) (NASDAQ: AVAV) will host an investor day in New York City on Wednesday, July 8, 2026. Management presentations and discussions can be viewed that day during a live webcast starting at 5:30 a.m. PT / 6:30 a.m. MT / 7:30 a.m. CT / 8:30 a.m. […]",
